  "title": "Calendar Invitations: Email Invites, Answers and Updates | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "With Calendar Invitations on, Orchard Core emails the people invited to a calendar event: an invitation with a calendar file and Accept, Maybe and Decline links, then updates and cancellations. Guests answer from the email without signing in.\n\nIn this video:\n• What is sent, and to whom\n• Setting up email and the site's Base url\n• Inviting a user of the site and a guest\n• Answering from the email, and seeing the answer on the event\n• Updates and cancellations",
